  summary: { title: 'You can design an analytics platform', sub: 'Ingest, lake, catalog, query, visualize', text: `<p>Ingest with Kinesis, Firehose or DMS into an S3 data lake (zones, Parquet, partitions). Glue crawls and transforms; Lake Formation governs fine-grained access. Athena queries S3 serverlessly; Redshift is the warehouse for heavy BI (Serverless, Spectrum, zero-ETL). EMR for Spark/Hadoop, OpenSearch for logs and search, QuickSight for dashboards. Keep analytics off the OLTP database.</p>` },
